## 4. Routes

```
/principal
  /overview                          stat cards, pending approvals
  /students
    /                                class section grid
    /classes/[sectionId]             roster
    /[studentId]                     student profile
  /faculty
    /                                faculty list
    /[teacherId]                     faculty profile
  /approvals                         existing pending-teacher queue
```

Keep approvals where they are — it's a queue, not a directory, and folding it into Faculty muddles "people who work here" with "people asking to."

